{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, move and grab it. Release at destination, then check properties. Otherwise, search.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbed    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />",
